            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2025-08-06T14:40:56+02:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EWed, 08/06/2025 - 14:40\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-03-05T13:24:00+01:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EThu, 03/05/2026 - 13:24\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "answer_part_1": "\u003Cp\u003EFarzandingizning xavfsizligini taʼminlash va u uxlab yotganda xotirjam boʻlishingiz uchun uning tugʻilishidanoq bir nechta oddiy qoidalarga amal qilishni boshlang. Birinchidan, karavotidan yostiq va oʻyinchoqlarni olib tashlang. Ikkinchidan, har doim chaqaloqni orqa tomoni bilan yotqizing.\u003C/p\u003E",
            "answer_part_2": "\u003Cp\u003EUchinchidan, agar siz chaqalog'ingiz bilan uxlasangiz ehtoyot choralarini ko'ring va bolaning yonida u yotgan xonada chekmang. Bunday ehtiyot choralari chaqaloqning to'satdan o'lish sindromi ehtimolini kamaytiradi.\u003C/p\u003E",
