            "type": "FAQ",
            "question": "Farzandim maktabda muvaffaqiyatga erishish uchun zarur boʻlgan bilimlarni egallayotganini qanday bilishim mumkin?",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2025-08-06T14:24:56+02:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EWed, 08/06/2025 - 14:24\u003C/time\u003E\n",
